The current location of a monster is m->mx and m->my

For the depth of the current level, depth(&u.uz)

For whether you are in Gehennom, try In_hell(&u.uz)

For a particular special level, there are Is_* defines in dungeon.h

For particular branches, In_* defines in dungeon.h

